+// WebOfShadowsRecomp (wos/patches/rexglue/0008): texture dumps and replacements.
+//
+// Each texture the GPU loads is fingerprinted with XXH3 over its guest data (the
+// base level and, when it has them, its mips, as the guest stores them: tiled and
+// big-endian). With wos_texture_dump on, the data of every fingerprint not yet
+// dumped is written to <title>/mods/dump/ with the format in its name; a file
+// <fingerprint>.bin of the same size in <title>/mods/textures/ is copied over the
+// guest's data before the load, so the GPU loads that instead (wos/tools/
