+// WebOfShadowsRecomp (0013): the parameters depend only on the fetch constant,
+// the binding's filters and the anisotropy setting, and were worked out for
+// every sampler of every draw (5% of the command processor's time): a small
+// direct-mapped cache of the last results, on the command processor's thread.
